{
  "appUI": 1,
  "id": "showcase",
  "title": "Aurora Showcase",
  "placement": "overlay",
  "width": 360,
  "height": 640,
  "dismissible": true,
  "autoOpen": false,
  "body": {
    "type": "column",
    "spacing": 8,
    "scroll": true,
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Aurora Showcase",
        "style": "heading"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这个窗口用了 UI pack 能改的全部节点样式、主题 token、透明度、圆角和图标映射。",
        "style": "body"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Muted · 次要说明文字",
        "style": "muted"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Danger · 危险操作提示",
        "style": "danger"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "**Markdown** 也支持 `行内代码` 和列表：\n- 主题\n- 组件\n- 布局",
        "style": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "type": "divider"
      },
      {
        "type": "row",
        "spacing": 10,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "左列 (weight 1)",
            "weight": 1.0,
            "style": "label"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "右列 (weight 1)",
            "weight": 1.0,
            "style": "label"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "spacer",
        "size": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "progress",
        "value": 0.62
      },
      {
        "type": "progress",
        "indeterminate": true
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "language": "json",
        "maxLines": 8,
        "text": "{\n  \"theme\": \"aurora\",\n  \"cornerRadius\": 26,\n  \"bubbleRadius\": 28,\n  \"chipRadius\": 12,\n  \"composerRadius\": 30,\n  \"alphas\": [0.42, 0.24, 0.55, 0.85, 0.22]\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "textfield",
        "id": "name",
        "placeholder": "输入点什么…",
        "maxLines": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "id": "mode",
        "value": "aurora",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Aurora",
            "value": "aurora"
          },
          {
            "label": "Solar",
            "value": "solar"
          },
          {
            "label": "Ice",
            "value": "ice"
          },
          {
            "label": "Mono",
            "value": "mono"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "toggle",
        "id": "verbose",
        "label": "详细输出",
        "value": true
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "headers": [
          "Token",
          "Value"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "cornerRadius",
            "26"
          ],
          [
            "bubbleRadius",
            "28"
          ],
          [
            "chipRadius",
            "12"
          ],
          [
            "composerRadius",
            "30"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "列表项 1 · 自动分隔线",
            "style": "body"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "列表项 2 · 自动分隔线",
            "style": "body"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "列表项 3 · 自动分隔线",
            "style": "body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/logo.png",
        "width": 120,
        "height": 120,
        "corner": 20,
        "alt": "Aurora logo"
      },
      {
        "type": "row",
        "spacing": 8,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "button",
            "label": "复制",
            "action": "builtin:copy:Aurora UI pack",
            "buttonStyle": "primary",
            "weight": 1.0
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "label": "关闭",
            "action": "builtin:close",
            "buttonStyle": "outline",
            "weight": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "label": "不可用按钮",
        "action": "builtin:close",
        "buttonStyle": "text",
        "enabled": false
      }
    ]
  }
}
